// Debug build settings for the MyApp target, wired in by project.yml's configFiles.
//
// A build for your own iPhone (`just run-device`) needs a development team. It lives
// only in Config/Local.xcconfig, which you create yourself, holding one line:
//
//   DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <your team ID>
//
// The team ID is the one Xcode › Settings › Accounts shows for your Apple account.
// Local.xcconfig is gitignored and the commit-time guard refuses it: a team ID belongs
// to one person's account, and this repository may be public. Simulator builds sign
// ad hoc and need no team, so the file is optional (hence `#include?`).
//
// Only Debug includes it: `just run-device` builds Debug and no Release route to a
// device exists. An app that adds distribution revisits this.
// See docs/running-on-device.md.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
